Type: Package
Package: lydemapr
Title: Mapping the Spread of Lycorma delicatula
Version: 4.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Seba", "De Bona", email = "sebastiano.debona@temple.edu", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Matt", "Helmus", email = "mrhelmus@temple.edu", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Seba De Bona <sebastiano.debona@temple.edu>
Description: This package contains aggregated, anonymized data on the
    presence/absence and population density of the Spotted Lanternfly
    (Lycorma delicatula) in the United States. The package contains
    functions to display the data through both table summaries and maps.
